@authUrl = http://localhost:5104
@availabilityUrl = http://localhost:5101
@bookingUrl = http://localhost:5102
@eventId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
@userId = 7bb85f64-1111-2222-3333-2c963f66af99

### ==================================================================
### 1. PASO 2 Consigna: Obtener Token JWT en Auth Server
### ==================================================================
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=cliente1&password=cliente1-dev

### Guardamos el token en una variable
@authToken = {{login.access_token}}


### ==================================================================
### 2. PASO 1 Consigna: Consulta pública de catálogo de asientos
### ==================================================================
GET {{availabilityUrl}}/api/seats
Accept: application/json


### ==================================================================
### 3. PASO 3 Consigna: Solicitud de Reserva Asíncrona (202 Accepted)
### ==================================================================
# @name createReservation
POST {{availabilityUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "seatNumber": "A-1",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "price": 15000.0
}

### Extraemos el ID de la reserva creada
@reservationId = {{createReservation.reservationId}}


### ==================================================================
### 4. PASO 7 Consigna: Polling de Estado a través de Availability
### ==================================================================
GET {{availabilityUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==================================================================
### 5. PASO 7 Consigna: Verificación interna directa en Booking
### ==================================================================
GET {{bookingUrl}}/api/bookings/{{reservationId}}
Accept: application/json
